OL,3,ARight-wing Flavio Bolsonaro wins first
OL,4,Around of Brazil election
OL,5,
OL,6,FRight-wing Flavio Bolsonaro has won the
OL,7,Ffirst round of Brazil's presidential
OL,8,Felection, beating left-wing President
OL,9,FLula da Silva, but falling short of an
OL,10,Foutright majority.
OL,12,FThere will be a run-off between the two
OL,13,Fcandidates on 25 October.
OL,15,FFlavio Bolsonaro is the son of the
OL,16,Fformer right-wing president Jair
OL,17,FBolsonaro, who is serving a 27-year
OL,18,Fprison sentence for masterminding a
OL,19,Ffailed coup after losing the 2022
OL,20,Felection.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
