OL,3,ARight-wing Flavio Bolsonaro wins first
OL,4,Around of Brazil election
OL,5,
OL,6,FSunday's vote was close, with President
OL,7,FLula polling slightly ahead during the
OL,8,Fcampaign. With almost all of the votes
OL,9,Fcounted, Bolsonaro had 47.03% to Lula's
OL,10,F45.16% of the vote.
